    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d89">

                <pb facs="0177" n="157" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v2/pg157"/>

                <head><seg type="margin">[634]</seg> *<hi rendition="#italic">General Miranda to Admiral Cochrane.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Barbadoes</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1806-06-09"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 9,
                        1806</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Having deliberately perused the foregoing
                    proposals, I hereby bind and oblige myself, as far as my authority can extend,
                    to see the same carried into execution; and that, to all intents and purposes,
                    the same shall be ratified and made binding on those provinces that may become
                    independent of Spain.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your most obedient, humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>F. DE MIRANDA.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Rear-Admiral the Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Cochrane</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Commander-in-Chief, &amp;c., &amp;c.,
                            Barbadoes.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
